{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e05-scene-08",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "今日から黒木香になります  (From Today On, Your Name Is Kaoru Kuroki)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "megumi": "恵美",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Rolling a handheld test camera in the office, Muranishi asks Megumi her favorite color—and in a flash of inspiration gives her the stage name that will shake all of Japan. Listen to Muranishi, Megumi, and Toshi in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "このまま君を撮るよ、いいね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一ついいか？好きな色は何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "黒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、じゃあ今日から君は黒木、黒木香だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すべてをさらけ出すんだぞ。俺のビデオは本番だからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "それ以外、何があるんですか？ちゃんと見てくださいね、これが私です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、剃れば問題ねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "剃りたくありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "剃る必要はない。すごくすてきだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "うれしい。私、今日から黒木香になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一回止めてくれ。気が変わった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木香のデビュー作だ。俺たちができる最高の準備をしてから撮影する。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "このまま君を撮るよ、いいね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm going to film you right here as we are, alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一ついいか？好きな色は何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'May I ask one thing? What is your favorite color?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "黒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Black.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よし、じゃあ今日から君は黒木、黒木香だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright — then starting today, you are Kuroki. Kaoru Kuroki.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すべてをさらけ出すんだぞ。俺のビデオは本番だからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bare everything you have; my videos are filmed for real.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "それ以外、何があるんですか？ちゃんと見てくださいね、これが私です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What else could there possibly be? Please look closely — this is who I am.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "いや、剃れば問題ねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, if she shaves her underarms it won't be an issue.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "剃りたくありません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have no wish to shave them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "剃る必要はない。すごくすてきだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is zero need to shave — they are truly wonderful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "うれしい。私、今日から黒木香になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That makes me happy. Starting today, I become Kaoru Kuroki.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一回止めてくれ。気が変わった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop the camera for now — I changed my mind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木香のデビュー作だ。俺たちができる最高の準備をしてから撮影する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Kaoru Kuroki's debut film; we shoot only after making the finest preparations we can.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "このまま君を撮るよ、いいね？",
      "gap": 0.5
