      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "黒木香のデビュー作だ。俺たちができる最高の準備をしてから撮影する。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to let her shave her natural underarm hair and realizing they are witnessing a once-in-a-lifetime star, Muranishi stops the camera so the crew can prepare their finest studio set! See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "また明日。",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
